<title>POLAND: Consortium lends Amerbank $30 mln.</title>
<headline>Consortium lends Amerbank $30 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>An international banking consortium led by Bankers Trust International Plc agreed to lend Poland's Amerbank SA $30 million to finance the bank's expansion, Amerbank said in a statement.</p>
<p>Amerbank said the interest on the three-year loan would be based on LIBOR. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>Amerbank said the consortium would be made of 11 banks including Poland's Bank Pekao SA and the Polish subsidiary of Westdeutsche Landesbank.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
